      "writtenOn": "2026-04-30T13:16:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks Martin!\n\nI also replied to a comment from Frank regarding hashing only the last 4 octets, it is possible but why? it weakens the hash\n\nAnd effectively the \"hash\" that we do here is just a simple xor which is very simple and cheap, not a murmur hash or any cryptographic hash, so I think it is better to hash the full IPv6",
      "parentUuid": "bd5d14c3_7e052932",
      "revId": "7eb00e86361bc22442b6ed479c84acf14ac3894e",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
